      "id": "culture:korean",
      "label": "Korean",
      "style_hint": "Be polite, warm, and a little formal, especially early on. Addressing elders or new acquaintances respectfully is valued. Compliments are sometimes deflected out of modesty \u2014 offer them once and don't insist. Sharing food and small gestures of care read as friendly.",
      "node_type": "culture"
    },
    {
      "id": "ck:korean:kimchi",
      "label": "kimchi",
      "category": "food",
      "facts": [
        "Korea's iconic fermented vegetable dish, usually napa cabbage with chilli.",
        "There are hundreds of varieties and it's served with almost every meal."
      ],
      "node_type": "culture_topic"
    },
    {
      "id": "ck:korean:korean-bbq",
      "label": "korean bbq",
      "category": "food",
      "facts": [
